            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase k'oriemo woko ji m'oyido jobedo i Bethsan gi calin mere, Tanak gi calin mere, Dor gi calin mere, Ibilim gi calin mere, Megido gi calin mere, to Jokanan jomedo bedo i lowo no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
