              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nafital k'oriemo woko ji m'oyido jobedo i Bethsemes kodi i Beth Anath, to jobedo i dier Jokanan m'oyido jobedo i lowo no. Kwanyo woko ji ma Bethsemes kodi ji ma Beth Anath jotimo rijo tic arom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
